 "balloons": [
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "JO\u00c3O"
   ],
   "text": "Up! Those marked go to the docks.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "joao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "JO\u00c3O"
   ],
   "text": "On your feet, marata. The Viceroy has found a use for you.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "joao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (whisper)"
   ],
   "text": "Rao.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PRISONER (behind)"
   ],
   "text": "To Angola. Africa.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "OLD PRISONER"
   ],
   "text": "Not this one. The Jesuits need bodies for their lands to the south.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "OLD PRISONER"
   ],
   "text": "They will work us until we forget our own names.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "JO\u00c3O"
   ],
   "text": "Faster. The tide waits for no man. Not even maratas.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "joao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "KESHAVRAO"
   ],
   "text": "Sahib.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Rao. You are still alive.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "KESHAVRAO"
   ],
   "text": "For now.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "KESHAVRAO (off, below)"
   ],
   "text": "Do you know where they send us?",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "South. That much is certain.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "KESHAVRAO"
   ],
   "text": "They need men to cut cane. Fields of sugar as tall as a man.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "KESHAVRAO"
   ],
   "text": "We will sweat for their salvation.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "We are not there yet. As long as we move, there is a chance.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "KESHAVRAO"
   ],
   "text": "The sahib still counts chances.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "It is what I know.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "SAILOR (above)"
   ],
   "text": "Wind is with us. If it holds we round the cape before the worst of the storms.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "SAILOR 2 (above)"
   ],
   "text": "This run is cursed. They say God sends warnings.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "OFFICER (above)"
   ],
   "text": "God sends opportunity. These bodies are silver if they live.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-05",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "OFFICER (above)"
   ],
   "text": "Pray for their health, not their souls.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "KESHAVRAO"
   ],
   "text": "If there is a storm, will the ship break?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "All ships break. The question is when and how.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "KESHAVRAO (quiet)"
   ],
   "text": "If the chains break too, I will follow wherever you jump, sahib.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "If there is a chance, I will not leave you.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  }
 ]
